TeaVM-javac
============

TraceJVM's browser compiler is built from TeaVM-javac:

  https://github.com/konsoletyper/teavm-javac

Pinned upstream commit:

  7e4a44cf521694a4e326e33850dd8aec165eb5c9

TeaVM-javac is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

TeaVM-javac uses components from the OpenJDK project, licensed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2, with the Classpath Exception. TraceJVM builds
the compiler against the pinned OpenJDK 23.0.2+7 source revision recorded in
compiler/teavm-javac/manifest.json.

TraceJVM changes TeaVM-javac to support its reproducible JDK 23 build,
nested source paths, and an explicit platform archive. The exact changed files,
patches, and checksums are recorded in compiler/teavm-javac/manifest.json and
compiler/teavm-javac/patches/.
